y":"source_printed_pages","html":"265"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"285"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e\">\\(P_e\\)</span>、通用编号谓词和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adec8e1737933ff1\" href=\"?note=adec8e1737933ff1\" title=\"43-df-enumeration-probability\">43-df-enumeration-probability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_e(A)&gt;0\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_e(A)&gt;0\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向由密度定理取一个条件概率超过1/2的柱集，再对每个候选元素采取测度多数票而枚举A；反向为忽略oracle的枚举程序，通用前缀给它正概率。核对了这两方向的源文，未独立重证密度定理。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.7.1 (de Leeuw–Moore–Shannon–Shapiro) and preceding observation；印刷页265，PDF页285。核对了本条所述短证明组合；底层定理证明并非全部重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text